"""amx: mechanics for agent sessions in tmux.

Registry, tmux and transcript operations for managed sessions
(Claude Code, pi, Codex or generic commands). Judgement stays with the
calling agent; amx only reads, reports and executes. Stdlib only.

Run `amx -h` or `amx <command> -h` for usage.
"""

